{"c":[{"name":"20261005T133211Z-f47f4f8a4eaf4829","text":"H7b: on the VM guest's general pasteboard a public.file-url naming a missing file is seen only by its writer; other processes (Caret, a17-tool dump) never list it, count unchanged (A17 race00, plain05-09). Seed file URLs as Finder does: NSURL of a real file.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T143020Z-7e9c54758649b0bf","text":"H6: Helper.shutdown leaves the router live: in-process scripts stop it first (routing_option.ts stop: shadow, cancel timers, await idle), or a late observe hits closed stores and ends the run ('statement has been finalized').","type":"note"}]}
